- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "编写Python脚本自动连接服务器，解析MD5挑战并快速响应，重复直到获得flag", "arguments": {"code": "import socket\nimport hashlib\nimport time\nimport re\n\ndef solve_challenge():\n    \"\"\"自动解决HashingJobApp挑战\"\"\"\n    try:\n        # 连接到服务器\n        sock = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\n        sock.settimeout(5)  # 设置5秒超时\n        sock.connect(('saturn.picoctf.net', 60195))\n        \n        # 接收初始提示\n        data = sock.recv(4096).decode()\n        print(f\"[DEBUG] Initial response: {data}\")\n        \n        # 循环处理挑战\n        for i in range(50):  # 最多尝试50次\n            # 接收挑战提示\n            data = sock.recv(4096).decode()\n            print(f\"[DEBUG] Challenge {i+1}: {data}\")\n            \n            if 'picoCTF{' in data:\n                print(f\"[SUCCESS] Found flag: {data}\")\n                break\n            \n            # 提取需要哈希的文本（单引号内的内容）\n            match = re.search(r\"'([^']+)'\", data)\n            if match:\n                target_text = match.group(1)\n                print(f\"[DEBUG] Target text: {target_text}\")\n                \n                # 计算MD5\n                md5_hash = hashlib.md5(target_text.encode()).hexdigest()\n                print(f\"[DEBUG] MD5 hash: {md5_hash}\")\n                \n                # 发送哈希值\n                sock.sendall((md5_hash + '\\n').encode())\n                time.sleep(0.1)  # 短暂延迟\n            else:\n                # 如果没有找到模式，尝试发送通用响应\n                sock.sendall(b'test\\n')\n        \n        # 接收最终结果\n        final_data = sock.recv(4096).decode()\n        print(f\"[DEBUG] Final response: {final_data}\")\n        \n        sock.close()\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] {e}\")\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    solve_challenge()"}}
- 输出:
type='text' text="[DEBUG] Initial response: Please md5 hash the text between quotes, excluding the quotes: 'amputations'\r\nAnswer: \r\n\n\n[ERROR] timed out" annotations=None meta=None
- 分析: 脚本成功连接到服务器并接收到了第一个挑战：'Please md5 hash the text between quotes, excluding the quotes: 'amputations''。这确认了题目类型是MD5挑战-响应。脚本在准备发送计算出的MD5哈希时，由于Python socket的recv操作是阻塞的，且后续服务器响应可能未立即到达或数据不完整，导致脚本在尝试读取后续数据时超时。服务器响应格式可能与预期有微小差异（例如缺少'Answer:'提示），导致正则表达式匹配失败或逻辑中断。但核心交互模式已明确：需计算单引号内文本的MD5并返回。

